WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.857
Some problems hide. Until you look through the right lens.

2
00:00:04.927 --> 00:00:10.104
<v Dev>Dev: The carbon lens! Making all that concrete gave off three times too much carbon.

3
00:00:10.174 --> 00:00:12.364
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. I only thought about strong.

4
00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:15.433
<v Posy>Posy: Warm, low-carbon homes from timber and straw.

5
00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:19.294
<v Florence>Florence: Timber and straw. Warm inside, and under the limit. Checked!

6
00:00:19.364 --> 00:00:23.702
Carbon hides in the things we build with. Timber and straw keep it low.

7
00:00:23.772 --> 00:00:27.776
And a plan that looks right is not proof. Always check with evidence.
